{
  "dom_id": "step-t7836",
  "name": "Traces of Hyperboloids of One Sheet",
  "problem": "The traces of a hyperboloid of one sheet are either ellipses or hyperbolas.\n\nFor example, let's find the traces with the coordinate planes for the hyperboloid of one sheet given by\n\n$$\nx^2+y^2-z^2=1.\n$$\n\n- The trace of this surface in the $xy$-plane (when $z=0$) is given by the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{0}^{2} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2}+{y}^{2} & =1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is a circle centered at the origin of radius $1$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14247644/assets/b369958a609ba3861be5d32fbf3195b6feb241228f81e89bb116b29f80e38318.png)\n\n   \n\n- The trace of this surface in the $xz$-plane (when $y=0$) is given by the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{0}^{2}-{z}^{2} & =1 \\\\ {x}^{2}-{z}^{2} & =1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is a hyperbola in the $xz$-plane centered at the origin.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14247644/assets/4c77b8758877ac88a73dece8c52f3b9cb650c4176edad5db020b138d70e0393b.png)\n\n- The trace of this surface in the $yz$-plane (when $x=0$) is given by the equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{0}^{2}+{y}^{2}-{z}^{2} & =1 \\\\ {y}^{2}-{z}^{2} & =1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is a hyperbola in the $yz$-plane centered at the origin.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14247644/assets/0ddcfc2e78166fa801a46deccd30c4cc2ddc12e81ae2e81508b5e13a374c208f.png)",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t7836\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Traces of Hyperboloids of One Sheet</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t7836\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>The traces of a hyperboloid of one sheet are either ellipses or hyperbolas.</p>\n<p>For example, let's find the traces with the coordinate planes for the hyperboloid of one sheet given by</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"17.332ex\" height=\"3.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1006.6 7462.3 1295.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-T